{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["tail.post"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Tail: reply, react, follow, lists, reports, profile"},"description":"The Tail actions the app has, on its own routes, for this account. For actions marked with a confirmation, an otherwise valid call without that body.confirmation returns a preview: show it and get the customer\u2019s yes before sending the literal. Other actions, including repost, send on a valid call; use them only when the customer asks. reply: POST tail/posts/{postId}/replies {text} (confirmation PUBLISH_REPLY); remove_reply: POST tail/replies/{replyId}/remove (confirmation DELETE_REPLY); like: POST tail/posts/{postId}/like {active}; add on another account\u2019s approved post; bookmark: POST tail/posts/{postId}/bookmark {active}; pin: POST tail/posts/{postId}/pin {active}; pin your own approved post; vote: POST tail/posts/{postId}/vote {choice: place|pass|null}; vote on another account\u2019s asking post; repost: POST tail/posts/{postId}/repost {active}; quote: POST tail/posts/{postId}/quotes {expectedRevision, text} (confirmation PUBLISH_QUOTE); poll_vote: POST tail/posts/{postId}/poll-vote {option 0-3}; relation: POST tail/relations {profileId, kind follow|mute|block, active}; list_create: POST tail/lists {name, description?} (confirmation CREATE_LIST); list_edit: POST tail/lists/{listId} {expectedRevision, name, description}; list_member: POST tail/lists/{listId}/members {profileId, active}; list_remove: POST tail/lists/{listId}/remove (confirmation DELETE_LIST); report_post: POST tail/reports body {postId, reason, details?} (confirmation REPORT_POST); report_reply: POST tail/replies/{replyId}/report {reason, details?} (confirmation REPORT_REPLY); report_profile: POST tail/profiles/{profileId}/report {reason, details?} (confirmation REPORT_PROFILE); delete_post: POST tail/posts/{postId}/remove (confirmation DELE